Package: oocol
Version: 0.2.0-1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: openOODA-tools <ops@openooda.org>
Depends: libc6
Description: ESCAPE FILTER
 Reverse line feed filter removing backspaces and half-line feeds from terminal output.
 Capability-bounded openOODA utility with zero ambient authority,
 terminal overstrike cleanup, and native Model Context Protocol (MCP) surface.
